\newlabel{tab:split_effect}{{6}{15}{Effect of replacing the naive record-level random split with review-grouped, deduplication-aware splitting (identical sizes: 5{,}480/609). Encoders isolate the split effect; the LLM deltas additionally include a prompt-serialization fix in the same pipeline revision. Every system \emph {improves} on the leak-free split}{table.caption.10}{}}
